abstract: >-
  The paper's analysis and its reproducible workflow: the Ebola study of the
  BDBV Modeling Hub and the German hospitalisation benchmark, comparing
  fine-tuned Chronos-2 foundation models, the joint-model-informed renewal
  model and baselines. Charlotte Holt contributed the foundation-model
  (fine-tuned Chronos-2) part.
